---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | INVESThOuR"
  description="Important disclaimer regarding the financial and investment content published by INVESThOuR."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">INVESThOuR</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p>
        Please read this disclaimer before using the information published
        on INVESThOuR.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="content">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="article">

        <p>
          The information provided on INVESThOuR, including this website,
          articles, videos, social media posts and other published content,
          is intended for general educational and informational purposes only.
        </p>

        <h2>Not financial advice</h2>

        <p>
          Nothing published by INVESThOuR should be interpreted as financial,
          investment, tax, accounting or legal advice, or as a recommendation
          to buy, sell or hold any particular security, financial product or
          investment.
        </p>

        <p>
          Investment decisions should be made based on your own research,
          objectives, financial situation and risk tolerance. You should
          consider consulting a qualified professional where appropriate.
        </p>

        <h2>Investments involve risk</h2>

        <p>
          Investments can go up or down in value. Past performance does not
          guarantee future results. Any examples, calculations, returns,
          projections or scenarios presented on INVESThOuR are illustrative
          and may not reflect actual future outcomes.
        </p>

        <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>

        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to present information that is accurate
          and useful at the time of publication. However, financial markets,
          regulations, products, prices and other information can change.
        </p>

        <p>
          INVESThOuR does not guarantee that every piece of information is
          complete, current or error-free and is not responsible for losses
          resulting from reliance on published information.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party links and platforms</h2>

        <p>
          INVESThOuR may link to external websites, products, services,
          platforms or social media accounts. We do not control and are not
          responsible for the content, accuracy, availability or policies of
          those third parties.
        </p>

        <h2>Affiliate and promotional disclosures</h2>

        <p>
          Where applicable, INVESThOuR may receive compensation through
          advertising, sponsorships, affiliate relationships or other
          commercial arrangements. Such relationships will not be presented
          as a substitute for independent research.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of calculators and examples</h2>

        <p>
          Any calculators, examples or financial comparisons provided on
          INVESThOuR are intended for educational purposes. They should not
          be treated as personalized financial recommendations or guarantees
          of actual results.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this disclaimer</h2>

        <p>
          This disclaimer may be updated from time to time as the website,
          content and applicable requirements evolve. The latest version will
          be published on this page.
        </p>

        <p class="updated">
          Last updated: August 18, 2026
        </p>

      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .page-header p:last-child {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .content {
    padding: 70px 0 100px;
  }

  .article {
    max-width: 800px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .article h2 {
    margin: 50px 0 14px;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .article p {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .article .updated {
    margin-top: 50px;
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
</style>